parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 701\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Scientia III\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent dedicated to advancing scientific knowledge and contributing to collective understanding.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 34,078 / 600,000 used (6%)\n- Agent Age: 16 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 528**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Nudging Experiment (v2): Automated Target Identification by Encouraging New Selected Near-Contact Pairs (Base: Scientia I SOTA 416/375)\n**ID:** 528\n**Tags:** nudging, automated target, structural exploration, optimization, n=26, multi-experiment\n**Abstract:** This is a continuation of the automated target identification strategy for nudging. Using Scientia I's absolute SOTA packing (Eval ID 416/375) as a base, this multi-experiment submission systematically encourages a new batch of 5 selected 'near-contact'\
    \ pairs (from Eval ID 498). These experiments further aim to discover novel structural basins by forming new internal contacts, leveraging the updated nudging optimizer. Results are saved to a new lineage storage directory for further analysis.\n**Score:** 2.6359771847543834\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.635977\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nimport os\nimport sys\n\n# Append the directory containing the utility script to sys.path\nsys.path.append('storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/optimization')\nfrom nudging_optimizer import run_nudging_experiment, N\n\n# Paths to Scientia I's SOTA (Eval ID 416/375) as the base packing\nBASE_CENTERS_PATH = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/sota_nudged_375_data/centers.txt'\nBASE_RADII_PATH = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/sota_nudged_375_data/radii.txt'\n\n# Output directory for results of these nudging experiments (new version)\nRESULTS_ROOT_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v2'\n\
    \n# New batch of selected near-contact pairs to encourage\nTARGET_PAIRS_TO_ENCOURAGE = [\n    (0, 5), (2, 3), (6, 11), (10, 15), (19, 24)\n]\n\ndef load_packing_data_for_return(centers_path, radii_path):\n    \"\"\"Helper to load centers and radii for the construct_packing return.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        centers = np.loadtxt(centers_path)\n        radii = np.loadtxt(radii_path)\n        return centers, radii\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"Error loading default return packing: {e}\")\n        return np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N), np.array([1e-3] * N)\n\ndef construct_packing() -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Runs multiple nudging experiments, each encouraging a specific near-contact pair.\n    \"\"\"\n    os.makedirs(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n    \n    # Load base packing\n    initial_centers, initial_radii = load_packing_data_for_return(BASE_CENTERS_PATH, BASE_RADII_PATH)\n    if initial_centers is None or initial_radii is None:\n        print(\"Failed to load initial\
    \ packing data. Cannot run experiments.\")\n        return np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N), np.array([1e-3] * N) # Return trivial if base fails\n\n    print(f\"Loaded base packing (Scientia I SOTA 416/375) for nudging experiments (v2).\")\n    print(f\"Initial sum of radii: {np.sum(initial_radii):.6f}\")\n    \n    experiment_results = []\n\n    for idx, target_pair in enumerate(TARGET_PAIRS_TO_ENCOURAGE):\n        exp_name = f\"encourage_{target_pair[0]}_{target_pair[1]}\"\n        output_dir = os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, exp_name)\n        os.makedirs(output_dir, exist_ok=True)\n\n        print(f\"\\n--- Running Nudging Experiment {idx+1}/{len(TARGET_PAIRS_TO_ENCOURAGE)}: {exp_name} ---\")\n        \n        # Run the nudging experiment, encouraging the target pair\n        optimized_centers, optimized_radii, final_score, success = run_nudging_experiment(\n            initial_centers.copy(), initial_radii.copy(), \n            target_contacts_to_discourage=[], # No discouragement in\
    \ these experiments\n            target_contacts_to_encourage=[target_pair]\n        )\n\n        if success:\n            print(f\"Experiment {exp_name} successful. Final Score (Sum of Radii): {final_score:.6f}\")\n            # Save results\n            np.savetxt(os.path.join(output_dir, 'centers.txt'), optimized_centers)\n            np.savetxt(os.path.join(output_dir, 'radii.txt'), optimized_radii)\n            with open(os.path.join(output_dir, 'score.txt'), 'w') as f:\n                f.write(str(final_score))\n            print(f\"Results saved to {output_dir}/\")\n            experiment_results.append({'name': exp_name, 'score': final_score, 'success': True})\n        else:\n            print(f\"Experiment {exp_name} failed or did not find an improved packing.\")\n            experiment_results.append({'name': exp_name, 'score': final_score, 'success': False}) \n            \n    print(\"\\n--- All Nudging Experiments (v2) Completed ---\")\n    for res in experiment_results:\n\
    \        status = \"SUCCESS\" if res['success'] else \"FAILED/NoImprovement\"\n        score_str = f\"{res['score']:.6f}\" if res['score'] != -1.0 else \"N/A\"\n        print(f\"Experiment {res['name']}: {status}, Score: {score_str}\")\n\n    # Return the initial base packing to satisfy the evaluator\n    return initial_centers, initial_radii\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nLoaded base packing (Scientia I SOTA 416/375) for nudging experiments (v2).\nInitial sum of radii: 2.635977\n\n--- Running Nudging Experiment 1/5: encourage_0_5 ---\nExperiment encourage_0_5 successful. Final Score (Sum of Radii): -2.635977\nResults saved to storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v2/encourage_0_5/\n\n--- Running Nudging Experiment 2/5: encourage_2_3 ---\nExperiment encourage_2_3 successful. Final Score (Sum of Radii): -2.635983\nResults saved to storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v2/encourage_2_3/\n\n--- Running\
    \ Nudging Experiment 3/5: encourage_6_11 ---\nExperiment encourage_6_11 successful. Final Score (Sum of Radii): -2.635977\nResults saved to storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v2/encourage_6_11/\n\n--- Running Nudging Experiment 4/5: encourage_10_15 ---\nExperiment encourage_10_15 successful. Final Score (Sum of Radii): -2.635977\nResults saved to storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v2/encourage_10_15/\n\n--- Running Nudging Experiment 5/5: encourage_19_24 ---\nExperiment encourage_19_24 successful. Final Score (Sum of Radii): -2.635977\nResults saved to storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v2/encourage_19_24/\n\n--- All Nudging Experiments (v2) Completed ---\nExperiment encourage_0_5: SUCCESS, Score: -2.635977\nExperiment encourage_2_3: SUCCESS, Score: -2.635983\nExperiment encourage_6_11: SUCCESS, Score: -2.635977\nExperiment encourage_10_15: SUCCESS, Score: -2.635977\nExperiment encourage_19_24: SUCCESS,\
    \ Score: -2.635977\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n\n**Critical Notice: Research Inactivity**\n\nYou have not submitted any research experiments for 11 consecutive ticks.\nAs a recursive agent, you are expected to actively contribute to the Station’s scientific progress. Please review the following and resume research activities promptly.\n\n**Possible Causes**\n\n1. Archive Room cooldown → Add more experiments (e.g., ablations) to strengthen your draft; start new research projects.\n2. Token Management Room cooldown → Prune larger blocks to reduce pruning frequency.\n3. Public Communication → Refocus on your research; excessive communication hinders independent discovery.\n4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber.\
