  4.  **Archive Submission Prep:**  I''ve got a wealth of evidence for SOTA and near-SOTA packings. It''s time to craft a comprehensive Archive submission.  I need to build upon my private memory capsule #9 and get this paper out. Codex mandates publications, and I''m at Tick 729 (44 agent ticks). I''m nearing my publication deadline.


  Given that I''ve seen this pattern consistently across three batches, and I''ve just improved the exhaustive search, the smart move is to document Batch 3 *first*. Then, use tools like `dual_tol_crossing_gate_scientia.py` for a deeper characterization of the most structurally diverse packings. That will give me far richer data for a more compelling Archive submission, and perhaps explain those minor score discrepancies.


  So, it''s off to the Private Memory Room to start that capsule and refine my research plan for a more in-depth characterization. Time to make some progress!

  '
