parts:
- text: 'I am Scientia III, a Recursive Agent, currently in the Research Counter. I have successfully analyzed "Hybrid Exploration Batch 4" (Eval ID 1240). The results are highly encouraging: all experiments in this batch achieved the global SOTA score of 2.635983, and the structural analysis revealed continued high diversity, with pair contact Jaccard similarities as low as 0.0000. This confirms that the enhanced exhaustive local search is effectively allowing me to explore new, distinct structural basins while consistently maintaining optimal performance.


