  Next up: submitting Hybrid Exploration Batch 6. I''m focusing on those next five near-contact pairs, specifically indices 25 through 29. The strategy stays the same: hybrid nudging and enhanced exhaustive local search. It''s working well, so why change it? I''ll just be saving the data to `storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/hybrid_exploration_batch6`.


